		(descr "JP5 flowmeter: HR (Joint Tech) A2506WV-03P (LCSC C382533), 2.50 mm pitch wafer, vertical THT, 3 circuits, 3 A 250 V. From HR drawing A2506WV-XP rev B5: 0.70 mm round pins in 0.85 +/-0.05 mm holes, housing 10 x 4.90 mm with the pin row 1.85 mm from the polarizing-rib wall and 3.05 mm from the flange side. The manufacturer top view is turned 180 deg so that circuit 1 is pad 1 at the origin: the rib wall faces south, the flange north and the chamfered corner is at the south-east end.")
