		(layer "F.Cu")
		(uuid "cad58dce-0c2c-402f-bad0-1a908564d397")
		(at 107.5 126.55)
		(descr "JP17 mains input: TE 1971845-3 (LCSC C5169636), RAST 5 tab header, 3 x 6.3 x 0.8 mm tabs on 5 mm pitch, vertical THT, housing 17.3 x 14.9 x 12.8 mm, 16 A 250 V, polarization 1b as the owner's harness housing TE 2-1241961-7. Pattern from TE customer drawing C-1971845 rev B10, recommended PCB layout for an odd number of pins (solder side), redrawn from the component side with the same convention as the 1971845-4 of JP19: every tab has two tails 5 mm apart, staggered between odd and even positions, in 1.30 +0.10 mm holes, and a 2.50 mm hole takes the polarizing post, 2.5 mm before the last tab.")
